<title>USA: TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$255,000 Hall of Fame Championships grass court tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>8-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat 3-Grant Stafford (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-3 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>5-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat 7-Leander Paes (India) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 2-6 6-3</p>
</text>
